      <title>华为Mate 80系列集体涨价最高1000元 Mate XT 2首搭灵盾防窥屏</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260901/%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%BAMate-80%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97%E9%9B%86%E4%BD%93%E6%B6%A8%E4%BB%B7%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%981000%E5%85%83-Mate-XT-2%E9%A6%96%E6%90%AD%E7%81%B5%E7%9B%BE%E9%98%B2%E7%AA%A5%E5%B1%8F/</link>
